Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.30,0:00:17.63,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,160)}In the Philippines, over a million sari-sari stores run on memory and guesswork.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.70,0:00:21.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,160)}It opens on today's real profit, not today's sales.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.74,0:00:27.41,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,160)}Every benta, utang and gastos is recorded in one ledger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.64,0:00:31.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,160)}Sale, utang, gastos, capital: all first-class entries.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.90,0:00:37.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,160)}Sipat, nakabenta ako ng sampung Coke.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.90,0:00:41.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,160)}Speak the sale in Taglish. No forms, no typing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.70,0:00:45.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,160)}SeePat prices it from your history and drafts it. You confirm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.75,0:00:50.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,160)}Then ask in your own words.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.35,0:00:53.65,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,160)}Nasaan ang puhunan ko? Where is my capital?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.95,0:00:58.25,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,160)}Every figure comes from your own ledger, not from a language model.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.79,0:01:04.69,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,160)}The Sipat Score grades the business out of one hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.79,0:01:09.19,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,160)}Every point is explained, in your own numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.49,0:01:15.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,160)}The voice model downloads once, then it lives on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.40,0:01:20.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,160)}No signal? It still records, and it still answers.
